XPL5Ez/images/get-started/devin-docs-new-intro.mp4?fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=iH03e_G1Q4XPL5Ez&amp;q=85&amp;s=5d6a80bf423c79699ac737faa89d9942" type="video/mp4" data-path="images/get-started/devin-docs-new-intro.mp4"/></video></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border border-black/5 rounded-2xl dark:border-white/5"></div><figcaption class="relative rounded-2xl text-center mt-3 pt-0 px-8 pb-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 [&amp;_p]:m-0 [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:border-b [&amp;_a]:border-primary [&amp;_a:hover]:border-b-2 dark:[&amp;_a]:text-white dark:[&amp;_a]:border-primary-light" data-component-part="frame-caption"><p>Devin 快速导览</p></figcaption></figure></div>
<span data-as="p">Devin 是一名自主工作的 AI 软件工程师，能够编写、运行和测试代码。Devin 可以处理大多数任务 (极其困难的任务除外) 。一个经验法则是：如果你能在三小时内完成某件事情，Devin 大概率也能完成。可以让 Devin 处理 Linear/Jira 工单，实现全新的功能，复现并修复 bug，构建内部工具等！</span>
<div role="note" aria-label="提示" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-green-200 bg-green-50 dark:border-green-900 dark:bg-green-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="tip"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" class="size-4.5 text-green-800 dark:text-green-300"><use href="#mi-mint-1-CalloutTip"></use></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-green-800 dark:text-green-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">在我们的<a class="link" href="/zh/release-notes/overview">发布说明</a>中了解 Devin 的最新动态！</span></div></div>
<div role="note" aria-label="注意" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 dark:border-blue-900 dark:bg-blue-600/20" data-callout-type="note"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" class="size-4 text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300"><use href="#mi-mint-1-CalloutNote"></use></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">在某些情况下，Devin 的实际表现可能与本文所述并不完全一致，或者文档内容可能已过时。</span></div></div>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="already-signed-up-get-started-now"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#already-signed-up-get-started-now" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">已注册？立即开始：</span></h2>
<div role="note" aria-label="提示" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-green-200 bg-green-50 dark:border-green-900 dark:bg-green-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="tip"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" class="size-4.5 text-green-800 dark:text-green-300"><use href="#mi-mint-1-CalloutTip"></use></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-green-800 dark:text-green-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p"><a class="link" href="/zh/use-cases/gallery/index">浏览使用场景</a></span></div></div>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="what-are-devins-strengths"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#what-are-devins-strengths" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Devin 的优势是什么？</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">以下是 Devin 擅长处理的任务类型：</span>
<ol>
<li><strong>并行处理大量任务，在它们进入你的 待办列表 之前完成</strong>
<ul>
<li>Linear / Jira 工单</li>
<li>从零开始实现完整功能</li>
<li>Bug 报告</li>
<li>应用测试</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>代码迁移、重构和现代化改造</strong>
<ul>
<li>语言迁移 (例如：JavaScript 到 TypeScript)</li>
<li>框架升级 (例如：Angular 16 -&gt; 18)</li>
<li>从 monorepo 转换为 submodule</li>
<li>移除未使用的 feature flag</li>
<li>将通用代码抽取为公共库</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>常见且重复的工程任务</strong>
<ul>
<li>PR Review</li>
<li>代码库问答</li>
<li>复现并修复 bug</li>
<li>编写单元测试</li>
<li>维护文档</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>客户工程支持</strong>
<ul>
<li>构建新集成并对接不熟悉的 API</li>
<li>创建自定义演示</li>
<li>方案原型设计 / 快速原型开发</li>
<li>构建内部工具</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<span data-as="p"><strong>要从 Devin 获得最佳效果：</strong></span>
<ul>
<li>编写清晰的提示，并明确完成标准——任务越清晰，成功率越高，尤其是对复杂工作。</li>
<li>让任务易于验证——例如检查 CI 是否通过，或测试一次自动部署。</li>
<li>对于更难的任务，将其拆分为边界清晰的步骤，并提供相关上下文或示例。</li>
<li>遵循我们的<a class="link" href="/zh/essential-guidelines/when-to-use-devin">最佳实践和任务前检查清单</a>。</li>
</ul>
<span data-as="p"><strong>最有效的工作流程通常包括：</strong></span>
<ul>
<li>在你和同事在 <a class="link" href="/zh/integrations/slack">Slack</a> 或 <a class="link" href="/zh/integrations/microsoft-teams">Teams</a> 讨论某个 bug 的会话线程中 @Devin</li>
<li>通过 Web 应用程序委派一个更复杂的任务，并在 Devin 的 IDE 给出不错的初稿后接手</li>
<li>在本地环境中运行 <a href="https://cli.devin.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">终端版 Devin</a>，直接在命令行中进行快速修复、代码探索和交互式编码——然后使用 <a class="link" href="/zh/cli/handoff"><code>/handoff</code></a> 将耗时更长的任务交给云端 Devin。</li>
<li>在一天开始时从待办清单中拆分出适合的任务交给 Devin，之后再回来查看等待你审核的草稿 PR</li>
</ul>
<span data-as="p">当你把 Devin 融入团队和现有工作流程时，它的效果最佳。</span>
<div><figure data-name="frame" class="frame p-2 not-prose relative bg-gray-50/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800/25 print:print-color-exact"><div style="background-position:10px 10px" class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-neutral-200/20 [mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0.6))] dark:bg-grid-white/5 dark:[mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.1),rgba(255,255,255,0.5))] print:print-color-exact"></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex justify-center [&amp;_:where(img:not([class*=rounded-]))]:rounded-xl"><span data-ramka-trigger="" class="zoom-image-trigger contents cursor-zoom-in"><span class="contents"><picture class="contents"><img data-path="images/SlackGIF.gif" src="https://mintcdn.com/cognitionai/a0js040y87FuBerW/images/SlackGIF.gif?s=f1120b81fda6946dfdb28734362212e3" class="object-contain" width="852" height="480" decoding="async" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" data-optimize="true" style="aspect-ratio:852 / 480;width:100%;height:auto"/></picture></span></span><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-ramka-trigger="" aria-label="放大图片" class="inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-black/20 bg-white/55 text-neutral-900 shadow-[0_0.5px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/0.12),0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08),inset_0_0.5px_0_rgb(255_255_255/0.65)] backdrop-blur-[40px] backdrop-saturate-150 transition-[background-color,box-shadow,scale,opacity,color] duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-white/65 active:scale-[0.96] active:bg-white/75 focus:outline-hidden focus-visible:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.25),0_0.5px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/0.12),0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08),inset_0_0.5px_0_rgb(255_255_255/0.65)] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-30 disabled:active:scale-100 dark:border-white/25 dark:bg-neutral-900/45 dark:text-white dark:shadow-[0_0_0_0.5px_#000,0_0.5px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/0.45),0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.35),inset_0_0.5px_0_rgb(255_255_255/0.14)] dark:hover:bg-neutral-900/55 dark:active:bg-neutral-900/65 dark:focus-visible:shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgb(255_255_255/0.4),0_0_0_0.5px_#000,0_0.5px_1px_rgb(0_0_0/0.45),0_1px_2px_rgb(0_0_0/0.35),inset_0_0.5px_0_rgb(255_255_255/0.14)] absolute z-10 size-px overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap [clip-path:inset(50%)] pointer-events-none focus-visible:size-9 focus-visible:overflow-visible focus-visible:[clip-path:none] focus-visible:pointer-events-auto in-[a]:hidden"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-4 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Expand"></use></svg></button></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border border-black/5 rounded-2xl dark:border-white/5"></div><figcaption class="relative rounded-2xl text-center mt-3 pt-0 px-8 pb-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 [&amp;_p]:m-0 [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:border-b [&amp;_a]:border-primary [&amp;_a:hover]:border-b-2 dark:[&amp;_a]:text-white dark:[&amp;_a]:border-primary-light" data-component-part="frame-caption"><p>Slack 中的 Devin</p></figcaption></figure></div>
<div id="general-product-features"><h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="general-product-features"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#general-product-features" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">产品通用功能</span></h2></div>
<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="the-devin-interface"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#the-devin-interface" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Devin 界面</span></h3>
<span data-as="p">Devin 被设计为一个对话式用户界面，你可以在内嵌的 IDE 中实时查看并接管 Devin 的开发过程。Devin 也可以通过 <a class="link" href="/zh/api-reference/overview">Devin API</a> 使用。</span>
<span data-as="p">在 Devin 的 Workspace 中，你会看到 Devin 为你完成任务时使用的<a class="link" href="/zh/work-with-devin/devin-session-tools">开发者工具</a>。</span>
<div class="columns prose dark:prose-invert grid max-w-none gap-4 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(var(--cols),minmax(0,1fr))] @2xl/columns-container:grid-cols-[repeat(var(--cols),minmax(0,1fr))] @[0px]/columns-container:grid-cols-1 card-group dark:prose-dark gap-y-0 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(var(--cols),minmax(0,1fr))]!" style="--cols:3"><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/rectangle-terminal.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/rectangle-terminal.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_575dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white mt-4" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="card-title">Shell</h2><div id="_R_575dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutbH1_" class="prose mt-1 font-normal text-base leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400" data-component-part="card-content"><span data-as="p">Devin 的终端，你可以在这里观察命令的执行情况并查看输出日志。你也可以复制 Shell 输出用于调试。如果你想直接运行命令，请使用 IDE 的 Shell。</span></div></div></div></div><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/code.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/code.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_975dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white mt-4" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="card-title">IDE</h2><div id="_R_975dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutbH1_" class="prose mt-1 font-normal text-base leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400" data-component-part="card-content"><span data-as="p">Devin 内嵌的代码编辑器，配备你熟悉的所有 IDE 工具和快捷键。你可以实时跟踪 Devin 的工作，并在需要时接管来运行命令、直接修改代码或测试 Devin 的代码。</span></div></div></div></div><div class="card block font-normal group relative my-2 ring-2 ring-transparent rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="px-6 py-5 relative" data-component-part="card-content-container"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 fill-gray-800 dark:fill-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-6" data-component-part="card-icon"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! size-6 m-0! shrink-0 bg-primary dark:bg-primary-light" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/browser.svg&quot;);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/fontawesome/v7.2.0/regular/browser.svg&quot;);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center"></svg></div><div class="w-full"><h2 id="_R_d75dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_" class="not-prose font-semibold text-base text-gray-800 dark:text-white mt-4" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="card-title">Browser</h2><div id="_R_d75dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutbH1_" class="prose mt-1 font-normal text-base leading-6 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400" data-component-part="card-content"><span data-as="p">你可以看到 Devin 如何浏览文档、测试其构建的 Web 应用程序、下载/上传信息等更多内容。你也可以通过 Interactive Browser 随时介入，帮助 Devin 完成浏览相关任务。</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div><figure data-name="frame" class="frame p-2 not-prose relative bg-gray-50/50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden dark:bg-gray-800/25 print:print-color-exact"><div style="background-position:10px 10px" class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid-neutral-200/20 [mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0.6))] dark:bg-grid-white/5 dark:[mask-image:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.1),rgba(255,255,255,0.5))] print:print-color-exact"></div><div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex justify-center [&amp;_:where(img:not([class*=rounded-]))]:rounded-xl"><video controls="" width="100%" playsInline=""><source src="https://mintcdn.com/cognitionai/IDtCf_RaYAXtqaVv/images/get-started/devintoolsnew.mp4?fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;n=IDtCf_RaYAXtqaVv&amp;q=85&amp;s=217ee85538ed624e0f737520d262ea26" type="video/mp4" data-path="images/get-started/devintoolsnew.mp4"/></video></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none border border-black/5 rounded-2xl dark:border-white/5"></div><figcaption class="relative rounded-2xl text-center mt-3 pt-0 px-8 pb-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 [&amp;_p]:m-0 [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:border-b [&amp;_a]:border-primary [&amp;_a:hover]:border-b-2 dark:[&amp;_a]:text-white dark:[&amp;_a]:border-primary-light" data-component-part="frame-caption"><p>你可以在侧边栏或通过点击会话中的任意进度步骤来找到 Devin 的工具</p></figcaption></figure></div>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="getting-access"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#getting-access" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">获取访问权限</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">要访问 Devin，请在 <a href="https://app.devin.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">app.devin.ai</a> 注册。提供个人和 Teams 套餐。</span>
<span data-as="p">你也可以安装 <a class="link" href="/zh/cli">Devin CLI</a>，通过命令行直接使用 Devin：</span>
<div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" numberOfLines="1" language="shellscript"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="code-block-copy-button z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_v5h5dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/copy-button [.code-block_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800 [.code-block:has([data-fade-overlay])_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-transparent dark:[.code-block:has([data-fade-overlay])_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-transparent" data-testid="copy-code-button" aria-label="复制代码块内容"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/copy-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/copy-button:text-white/60"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Copy"></use></svg></button><span role="status" class="sr-only"></span></div><div class="z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_vlh5dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/ask-assistant-button [.code-block_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800 [.code-block:has([data-fade-overlay])_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-transparent dark:[.code-block:has([data-fade-overlay])_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-transparent" id="ask-assistant-code-block-button" aria-label="询问助手" data-chat-payload-element-id="lang-shellscript-code-curl_-fsSL_https___c"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="1.5" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/ask-assistant-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/ask-assistant-button:text-white/60"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Sparkle"></use></svg></button></div></div><div role="presentation" style="position:relative;--scroll-area-corner-height:0px;--scroll-area-corner-width:0px;font-variant-ligatures:none;height:auto;background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#0B0C0E" data-component-part="code-block-root" class="w-0 min-w-full max-w-full h-full dark:bg-codeblock text-sm leading-6 transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in-out code-block-background **:ring-0 **:outline-0 **:focus:ring-0 **:focus:outline-0 rounded-2xl bg-white"><div data-id="base-ui-_R_ph5dd7av5tcd74t9snpfiutb_-viewport" tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] py-3.5 px-4 overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content" class="min-w-full! h-full children:my-0! children:shadow-none! children:bg-transparent!"><div class="font-mono whitespace-pre leading-6"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light-default dark-plus" style="background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#0B0C0E;color:#1f2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4" language="shellscript"><code language="shellscript" numberOfLines="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#DCDCAA">curl</span><span style="color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#569CD6"> -fsSL</span><span style="color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178"> https://cli.devin.ai/install.sh</span><span style="color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4"> |</span><span style="color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#DCDCAA"> bash</span></span>
</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div>
<span data-as="p">如果你的公司已经在与 Cognition 合作，你可以向你的管理员或直接向 Cognition 申请权限，并通过 Web 应用 <a href="https://app.devin.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">app.devin.ai</a> 访问 Devin。</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="feedback"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#feedback" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">反馈</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">我们一直在不断改进，而客户的意见至关重要！你可以发送邮件至 <a href="mailto:support@cognition.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">support@cognition.ai</a>、<a href="https://app.devin.ai/settings/support" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">通过 Slack Connect</a> (适用于 Teams 用户) ，或直接在 Web 应用中点击 sidebar 底部的 <strong>Help</strong> (问号) 图标并选择 <strong>Contact support</strong> 来提交反馈。</span>
<span data-as="p">我们会记录客户提供的所有反馈，用于快速改进 Devin，并指导我们的产品优先级和路线图规划。</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="demo"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#demo" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">演示</span></h2>
<span data-as="p">如需了解更多，请访问我们的<a href="https://cognition.com/blog/devin-generally-available" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">博客</a>。</span>
<div data-as="iframe" class="flex justify-center w-full"><div class="object-contain w-full mint-max-w-full" style="height:473px;width:840px;aspect-ratio:840 / 473"></div></div>
<div id="about-cognition"><h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="about-cognition"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#about-cognition" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="导航到标题">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="2" class="size-3 shrink-0"><use href="#mi-mint-1-Link"></use></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">关于 Cognition</span></h2></div>
<span data-as="p">我们是一家构建端到端软件智能体的应用型 AI 实验室。</span>
<span data-as="p">我们正在打造 AI 软件工程师，帮助有抱负的工程团队高效清理积压工作。</span></div><nav id="pagination" data-layout-item="pagination" aria-label="Pagination" class="px-0.5 flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200"><a rel="next" aria-label="下一页: 你的首次会话" data-component-part="pagination-next" class="group flex items-center min-w-0 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary dark:focus-visible:outline-primary-light gap-3 rounded-sm ml-auto pagination-next" href="/zh/get-started/first-run"><div class="truncate group-hover:text-gray-900 dark:group-hover:text-white" data-component-part="pagination-title">你的首次会话</div><svg viewBox="0 0 3 6" aria-hidden="true" data-component-part="pagination-chevron" class="h-1.5 shrink-0 stroke-gray-400 overflow-visible group-hover:stroke-gray-600 dark:group-hover:stroke-gray-300 rotate-180"><path d="M3 0L0 3L3 6" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></nav><div data-assistant-bar="" class="left-0 right-0 sticky bottom-0 w-full overflow-hidden z-20 pointer-events-none print:hidden"><div class="chat-assistant-floating-input w-full group/assistant-bar relative before:content-[&quot;&quot;] before:absolute before:left-0 before:right-0 before:top-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] sm:before:top-[calc(50%-0.75rem)] before:h-[200px] before:bg-background-light dark:before:bg-background-dark translate-y-[100px] opacity-0"><div class="relative pb-4 sm:pb-6"><div class="flex flex-col w-full rounded-2xl pointer-events-auto bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/10 focus-within:border-primary dark:focus-within:border-primary-light transition-colors"><div class="relative flex items-end"><textarea id="chat-assistant-textarea" aria-label="提出问题..." autoComplete="off" placeholder="提出问题..." class="chat-assistant-input w-full bg-transparent border-0 peer/input text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 placeholder-gray-600 da